ult|n|That branch of mathematics which investigates the relations, properties, and measurement of solids, surfaces, lines, and angles; the science which treats of the properties and relations of magnitudes; the science of the relations of space. ; A treatise on this science.	a:1uso,40,4;1vz5,31,2~1uso,40,4;1vz5,31,2	n:e9h,62,7;1vz5,47,6;1zqp,26,4;1abo,22,3;1gm9,22,4;6r5,9,4~e9h,62,7;1vz5,47,6;1zqp,26,4;6r5,9,4;1gm9,22,4;1abo,22,3
